"There truly is no greater purpose in life than to be praised by a spirit in an amulet."

"Don't be discouraged, Barry!" Hadrik says, laughing. "I'm sure you'll find an even greater purpose one day. Though topping this won't be easy!"

"I remain skeptical, but hopeful," I say.

"Listen," Daren says, cutting in. "If we're done racking our brains, I'd rather return to our plans regarding the king of the underground and the rebels. What do you think about the delegation to the Overseer? Should we go along with it or not?"

