choice("Continue", B3-Ch03a-Exploring, v_current_scene = B3-Ch03a-Exploring)


ID: B3-Ch03a-Evasive
TEXT:

"Why do you suppose that the Overseer was so evasive with its answers?"

"It clearly didn't trust Eiden enough to reveal its plans," Kate says. "Given that Eiden only recently appeared in this city, the Overseer hasn't had time to determine his true motives."

"I'm not entirely sure what to make of this, but we need to deliver this recording to the king immediately!" Peter says. "Bill, is everything ready?"

"Not yet," Bill says, pressing buttons on the console. "I need to transfer the data to the cube. Help me synchronize the channels—it will go faster with two sets of hands."

