ID: B3-Ch03a-Whim
TEXT:

"He's helped us before, but he mostly does it on a whim."

"On a whim?" the king of the underground asks. "What does that mean?"

"It means his motivations are erratic," I say. "He has tried to kill us on several occasions, so we hardly expect him to protect our interests. Most of the time, he acts purely to see what makes the situation more 'entertaining' for him. Beyond that, anyone's guess is as good as ours."

"I find that difficult to accept," the king says, leaning back. "It seems far more plausible that you and the 'Creator' are acting in concert, and you simply wish to conceal that alliance from us."

